      "writtenOn": "2017-02-03T23:25:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We only hash the inputs, not the outputs. Ideally I\u0027d embed the input hash directly into the output file, but I didn\u0027t want all the code to parse the buildID (https://golang.org/src/cmd/go/note.go). Instead I save it into a file (\u003coutput\u003e.hash), so this is reading the sha from the last build.",
