      "message": "Yes, Compile must always be called before Link. This isn\u0027t a library, so I\u0027m not overly concerned about someone getting this wrong. The next version also has a FindDeps function that must be called before Compile, just because that simplified things.\n\nEven if p.hashResult is nil, then it\u0027s just an empty slice, so it\u0027ll write an empty file.",
